  by: agent  # 63cb
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 63cb
  clock: 3  # 63cb
  nonce: 63cb  # 63cb
  message: "GOVERNANCE APPROVAL REQUESTED. The fix touches scripts/lib/forgejo-api.sh, a governance file, so per AGENTS.md no PR has been created and none will be until a human approves. The proposed patch is two lines (one '|| true' per branch of _manifest_selected_tests), verified against a scratch copy of the whole scripts/lib tree under 'set -euo pipefail' with a real 3-test committed manifest and a real 0-test regen: union returned 0 and preserved all three paths. The second defect named in the description (unioned header keeps the regen's 'Selected tests: 0' while the body carries the union) is NOT covered by that patch and needs its own line, rewriting the count from the unioned body. Blast radius today: every docs-only branch must be landed by manual push + merge-pr instead of auto-pr, which is the route AGENTS.md already permits and the route ADR-0046 is taking."  # 63cb
